  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『净小兽』车载空气净化器</strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e954162e42514a53b0562fe85a596296.jpg?auth_key=1795677197-75b780da6d25454dac5d9fc4f119c000-0-def15631abe056435f5c35fe1e7bfb292c79e6ac921cca0385d8757a49eb0dfa\" alt=\"IMG_20260527_114835.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 430.00px;height: 593.22px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-1 车载空气净化器</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">净小兽车载空气净化器，如图1-1，通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP”。用户通过车机大屏或车内语音助手，实现对车载空气净化器的开启、关闭等功能。同时支持各类场景自动化功能，例如“早上通勤”。</span></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/b91edaeb55164a34a376745c2e689065.png?auth_key=1795677197-1a7090bc195245af94dfe3f0c83e0aaa-0-5fe58fbd17ca945c8bd37727a53431c447d139a4c917d25f9b464e4690bd4da4\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a3df0de36f6f425c9d10083388315336.mp4?auth_key=1795677197-5b2e1a12573d4a6b98c2250cbee21633-0-efcc9a7b6b563786d070e888951614d6c95dce7f6552050562cd1297f586dffb\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">视频 1-1 车载空气净化器车机联动</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 车机大屏控制</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机大屏支持的空气净化器功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">开启</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">车载空气净化器</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">关闭</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">车载空气净化器</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"> 电池低电量时显示：电池电量低于20%，请及时充电；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a568bc502fdc4e8380d6145f4273c57f.png?auth_key=1795677197-e9caf1b6b304406eb4057223d0307366-0-5a006169ecccbc15de33bccb02bc5a8ef183e06a52fbb6345fea9240889ad860\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-2 智慧物联App-车载空气净化器设备详情</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 车机语音控制</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机智能语音控制车载空气净化器的功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">打开车载空气净化器；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">关闭车载空气净化器；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/6e996c5c5d224be6a3bf7a0410ee04ea.jpg?auth_key=1795677197-b750d40528c342c1a5815e49fe401102-0-3229c4c3c9bc2205328438a39768db85ae6a7165790bec29d0e0990e482010ec\" alt=\"IMG_20260527_114859.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 552.00px;height: 837.70px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 2-1 语音控制</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3. 场景自动化功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机端智慧物联App中，用户可以在“</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">智慧物联APP-&gt;场景</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">”多个场景分类中，根据需要添加车载空气净化器的功能，如开启等离子净化功能。具体以如下场景模式为例：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">早上通勤；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/5e61421a615e4306bfe6e2958090142e.png?auth_key=1795677197-620da2e955944b87bf2d45ebf47767ab-0-39211b1048a6fb95e7865fc9fde378f19c927d3926e8c27127d680748011bc39\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 809.00px;height: 455.05px;\"></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 3-1 场景自动化--打开车载空气净化器</span></p>"
}
